ions, accepted board/garrison conversion and corrected deck rebuilding. All relevant quoted facts checked against actual source.','','`results.json` records every original expected answer, exact observed answer, requested facts, actual snapshot evidence, source references, per-fact assessment, grade and reason, including B Q005’s fidelity issue and fresh-review request. Raw readers, summary, canonical text and fixed bank were unchanged.']
